  "releaseNotes": "⭐ Last 10 features:\n- feat(auth): recognize x-call-scoped-auth vendor extension as marker opt-in 2026-05-11\n- feat(auth): stamp AuthorizationOverride for per-op security overrides 2026-05-11\n- feat(auth): stamp call-scoped Authorization marker on HttpRequestMessage.Options 2026-05-11\n- feat(pageable): convenience LinkHeader overload over AutoSDKHttpResponse 2026-05-11\n- feat(pageable): wire has_more predicate and add Link-header pager 2026-05-11\n- feat(pageable): auto-detect cursor pagination patterns 2026-05-11\n- feat(pageable): emit AutoSDKPager + AutoPagingAsync for offset-paged endpoints 2026-05-11\n- feat(streaming): detect application/vnd.amazon.eventstream and parse frames 2026-05-11\n- feat(client): add options-with-no-baseUri constructor overload 2026-05-11\n- feat(polling): auto-detect 202+Location create-then-wait pairs 2026-05-11\n🐞 Last 10 bug fixes:\n- fix(ci): use renamed AutoSDKPromptTemplate types in CLI consumer fixture 2026-05-11\n- feat(streaming): detect application/vnd.amazon.eventstream and parse frames 2026-05-11\n- fix(multipart): suppress Stream overload when binary parts are optional 2026-05-11\n- fix(prompt-template): prefix helper DTO type names with AutoSDK 2026-05-11\n- fix(helpers): suppress CS1591 in generated opt-in helper files 2026-05-11\n- fix(json-converter): guard scoring fallback so it stops at first match 2026-05-10\n- fix(json-converter): dispatch oneOf by discriminator value 2026-05-10\n- fix(cli): normalize generated CLI source whitespace 2026-05-07\n- fix: make generated metadata trim safe 2026-05-07\n- fix: pin stream discriminator in multipart uploads 2026-05-05",
